  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Renewable Energy Master Plan for Syria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THe support goes to a comprehensive Renewable Energy Master Plan for Syria. The Plan will outline Syria&apos;s future energy demand and determine the share that can be met by renewable sources and include key measures such as reviewing existing regulations to align with international best practices. the plan will be integrated with the National Electricity Master Plan that UNDP has worked on the past years.</narrative>
  </description>
